      "message": "I imagined that in the scenario above we would introduce `EncodeWithMaxCompression`.  But if there is a need for a codec/jpg/png-agnostic compression level (integer or enum), then it also seems expressible at the `include/encode` level - why would encoding compression level be something that needs to be defined in XPS or SVG API?",
